/T (Zia is the AI layer built into the Zoho ecosystem, including Zoho Creator. Within Creator, the Zia Build Agent assists application builders by analyzing existing forms and reports, suggesting appropriate chart types, generating dashboard components, and surfacing patterns \(such as which service type or vehicle type occurs most often\) that would otherwise need manual analysis. Rather than requiring the developer to hand-build every chart, Zia-assisted suggestions speed up the process of turning a plain data table into a meaningful visual summary.)
